OL,3,GNEWSAFMQs: John Swinney faces
OL,4,Aaccusations of failing school pupils in
OL,5,AScotland
OL,6,
OL,7,FReform UK Scotland's Malcolm Offord
OL,8,Fsays the recently published Pisa
OL,9,Fstatistics on education are "disastrous
OL,10,Ffor young people and embarrassing for
OL,11,Fthe nation"
OL,13,FThe leader of the Scottish
OL,14,FConservatives, Russell Findlay, also
OL,15,Fraises the Pisa results, arguing
OL,16,FScottish pupils "have been failed by
OL,17,Fthis negligent, useless and complacent
OL,18,FSNP government"
